xt--BrHx7 m-top-32 m-top-24-xsm m-bottom-16 text-align-center-xsm" data-variant="heading-xl">Enhancv’s Resume Checker forms its ATS score with a two-tier system</h2><div class="text-align-center-xsm"><div class="_6KASKq_richText"><p>When you’re applying for a job, there’s a high chance your resume will be screened through an applicant tracking system before it finds its way on a recruiter’s screen. ATS helps hiring managers find the right candidates by adding their resumes to a database in a searchable format, extracting their content.</p><p>That’s why the success of your application is highly dependent on how tailored your resume is for the job you’re applying for, the resume template you’re using, and what skills and keywords you have included.</p><p>And then your resume must stand out in a pile of applicants, as well as deal with potential red flags, bias, discrimination, and role fit. Enhancv’s Resume Checker handles that by giving you the exact strategies you need to overcome this step.</p></div></div><div class="hidden-xl hidden-lg hidden-md m-top-40 m-bottom-24"><div class="nWyECq_wrap"><img alt="The proportion of content we can interpret" loading="lazy" width="540" height="428" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="nWyECq_poster" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw" srcSet="https://cdn.enhancv.com/images/256/i/aHR0cHM6Ly9lbmhhbmN2LmNvbS9fd2ViL19uZXh0L3N0YXRpYy9tZWRpYS9hdHMtcG9zdGVyLjJxODB1cWVpMml1ZGEud2VicA~~.webp 256w, https://cdn.enhancv.com/images/384/i/aHR0cHM6Ly9lbmhhbmN2LmNvbS9fd2ViL19uZXh0L3N0YXRpYy9tZWRpYS9hdHMtcG9zdGVyLjJxODB1cWVpMml1ZGEud2VicA~~.webp 384w, https://cdn.enhancv.com/images/430/i/aHR0cHM6Ly9lbmhhbmN2LmNvbS9fd2ViL19uZXh0L3N0YXRpYy9tZWRpYS9hdHMtcG9zdGVyLjJxODB1cWVpMml1ZGEud2VicA~~.webp 430w, https://cdn.enhancv.com/images/640/i/aHR0cHM6Ly9lbmhhbmN2LmNvbS9fd2ViL19uZXh0L3N0YXRpYy9tZWRpYS9hdHMtcG9zdGVyLjJxODB1cWVpMml1ZGEud2VicA~~.webp 640w, https://cdn.enhancv.com/images/750/i/aHR0cHM6Ly9lbmhhbmN2LmNvbS9fd2ViL19uZXh0L3N0YXRpYy9tZWRpYS9hdHMtcG9zdGVyLjJxODB1cWVpMml1ZGEud2VicA~~.webp 750w, https://cdn.enhancv.com/images/828/i/aHR0cHM6Ly9lbmhhbmN2LmNvbS9fd2ViL19uZXh0L3N0YXRpYy9tZWRpYS9hdHMtcG9zdGVyLjJxODB1cWVpMml1ZGEud2VicA~~.webp 828w, https://cdn.enhancv.com/images/1080/i/aHR0cHM6Ly9lbmhhbmN2LmNvbS9fd2ViL19uZXh0L3N0YXRpYy9tZWRpYS9hdHMtcG9zdGVyLjJxODB1cWVpMml1ZGEud2VicA~~.webp 1080w, https://cdn.enhancv.com/images/1080/i/aHR0cHM6Ly9lbmhhbmN2LmNvbS9fd2ViL19uZXh0L3N0YXRpYy9tZWRpYS9hdHMtcG9zdGVyLjJxODB1cWVpMml1ZGEud2VicA~~.webp 1200w, https://cdn.enhancv.com/images/1080/i/aHR0cHM6Ly9lbmhhbmN2LmNvbS9fd2ViL19uZXh0L3N0YXRpYy9tZWRpYS9hdHMtcG9zdGVyLjJxODB1cWVpMml1ZGEud2VicA~~.webp 1920w" src="https://cdn.enhancv.com/images/1080/i/aHR0cHM6Ly9lbmhhbmN2LmNvbS9fd2ViL19uZXh0L3N0YXRpYy9tZWRpYS9hdHMtcG9zdGVyLjJxODB1cWVpMml1ZGEud2VicA~~.webp"/></div></div><div class="p-16"><div class="rtDF2W_pointNumber">1</div><h3 class="Text-module__text--BrHx7 m-bottom-16 m-top-16" data-variant="heading-m">The proportion of content we can interpret</h3><p class="Text-module__text--BrHx7 m-bottom-24" data-variant="body-m">Similar to an ATS, the tool analyzes and attempts to comprehend your resume’s content and structure, against a job description, if you provide one, or based on signals we know from evaluating and researching hundreds of ATS platforms, such as Greenhouse, Lever and Workday. If the checker is able to understand what skills, experiences and sections your resume has, this means the company ATSes also do.</p></div><div class="UyAORW_magnifier relative flex flex-justify-center hidden-xl hidden-lg hidden-md"><img alt="The proportion of content we can interpret" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/images/resume-checker/ats-section/mobile-resume.svg 430w, /images/resume-checker/ats-section/mobile-resume.svg 640w, /images/resume-checker/ats-section/mobile-resume.svg 75