r","eyebrowStyle":"label","title":"Is your resume good enough?","titleHighlight":null,"titleSize":"xl","subtitle":"A free and fast AI resume checker doing 27 crucial checks to ensure your resume’s content, layout and design is technically compatible with the applicant tracking systems and get you interview callbacks.","bulletsLayout":"list","trustLine":null,"trustIcon":"none","socialProof":"none","logosLabel":null,"eyebrowInTitle":true,"subtitleSize":"md","breadcrumbParentLabel":null,"breadcrumbParentUrl":null,"byline":false,"logosMaxWidth":null,"interviewsText":null,"bullets":[],"buttons":[],"links":[],"logos":[],"widget":{"id":1823,"type":"upload-resume","uploadTarget":"ats-report","title":null,"buttonLabel":null,"display":"box"},"visual":{"id":1421,"type":"illustration","animation":"flip","resumeId":null,"badgeText":null,"videoUrl":null,"illustration":"checker","alt":"Resume Checker Image","bleed":true,"foregroundAlt":null,"image":null,"imageMobile":null,"pairBackground":null,"pairForeground":null,"images":[],"poster":null}},"body":[{"id":2752,"title":"Enhancv’s Resume Checker forms its ATS score with a two-tier system","text":"\u003cp\u003eWhen you’re applying for a job, there’s a high chance your resume will be screened through an applicant tracking system before it finds its way on a recruiter’s screen. ATS helps hiring managers find the right candidates by adding their resumes to a database in a searchable format, extracting their content.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThat’s why the success of your application is highly dependent on how tailored your resume is for the job you’re applying for, the resume template you’re using, and what skills and keywords you have included.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAnd then your resume must stand out in a pile of applicants, as well as deal with potential red flags, bias, discrimination, and role fit. Enhancv’s Resume Checker handles that by giving you the exact strategies you need to overcome this step.\u003c/p\u003e","mediaPosition":"left","theme":"page-alt","illustration":"resume-grader","mediaFrame":"none","stickyMedia":false,"titleLevel":"h2","textAfter":null,"titleTag":null,"pointTag":null,"layout":"checker-ats","mediaAlt":null,"bullets":[],"media":null,"button":null,"widget":null,"points":[{"id":5697,"title":"The proportion of content we can interpret","text":"Similar to an ATS, the tool analyzes and attempts to comprehend your resume’s content and structure, against a job description, if you provide one, or based on signals we know from evaluating and researching hundreds of ATS platforms, such as Greenhouse, Lever and Workday. If the checker is able to understand what skills, experiences and sections your resume has, this means the company ATSes also do.","icon":null,"bullets":[],"image":{"id":2557,"documentId":"xwqnuics5dfwpbg98zzy9n6f","name":"mobile-resume.svg","alternativeText":"The proportion of content we can interpret","caption":null,"focalPoint":null,"width":303,"height":303,"formats":null,"hash":"page_builder_mobile-resume","ext":".svg","mime":"image/jpeg","size":2298.91,"url":"/images/resume-checker/ats-section/mobile-resume.svg","previewUrl":null,"provider":"local","provider_metadata":null,"folderPath":"/","createdAt":"2026-10-13T13:45:58.067Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-13T13:45:58.067Z","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T13:45:58.068Z","locale":null}},{"id":5705,"title":"What the checker identifies","text":"Although an ATS doesn’t look for spelling mistakes and poorly crafted content, recruitment managers certainly do. The second part of our score is based on the quantifiable achievements you have in your resume and the quality of the written content. The checker looks for ambiguous claims, unclear impact or missing context.","icon":null,"bullets":[{"id":10454,"text":"Spearheaded and executed innovative marketing campaigns that resulted in a \u003cstrong\u003e30% increase\u003c/strong\u003e in brand visibility and engagement within a six-month period."},{"id":10455,"text":"Successfully launched and expanded market presence into new demographics, leading to a \u003cstrong\u003e20% growth\u003c/strong\u003e in customer acquisition and market share."}],"image":null}],"__component":"sections.left-right"},{"id":798,"title":"The AI-powered Resume Checker goes beyond typos and punctuation","subtitle":"We’ve built in various AI models to check your resume against what both ATS software and human recruiters look for. The tool checks for 27 crucial things across seven different categories on your resume including ATS essentials, resume content, job tailoring with keywords in the most important sections of your resume, as well as HR red flags, potential discrimination reasons and your seniority fit. Here’s a full list of the checks you’ll receive:","variant":"checklist","columns":"cols-3","theme":"dark-edge","titleAlign":"center","mobileLayout":"stack","decor":"checker","titleSize":"h2","titleTag":null,"itemTag":"h6","subtitleSize":null,"button":null,"items":[{"id":5698,"title":"ATS essentials","text":null,"icon":"pdf","bullets":[{"id":10427,"text":"File format and size"},{"id":10428,"text":"ATS-friendly design"},{"id":10429,"text":"Professional email address"},{"id":10430,"text":"Header links compliance"},{"id":10431,"text":"Resume file name"},{"id":10432,"text":"Dates and links consistency"}],"image":null},{"id":5699,"title":"Resume sections","text":null,"icon":"file-text","bullets":[{"id":10433,"text":"Essential sections"},{"id":10434,"text":"Contact information"},{"id":10435,"text":"Section order"}],"image":null},{"id":5700,"title":"Content","text":null,"icon":"edit-pencil","bullets":[{"id":10436,"text":"ATS parse rate"},{"id":10437,"text":"Quantifying impact with AI rewrite suggestions"},{"id":10438,"text":"Repetition of words and phrases"},{"id":10439,"text":"Spelling and grammar"},{"id":10440,"text":"Bullet length and consistency"}],"image":null},{"id":5701,"title":"Job tailoring","text":null,"icon":"crosshair","bullets":[{"id":10441,"text":"Hard skills match"},{"id":10442,"text":"Soft skills match"},{"id":10443,"text":"Action verbs"},{"id":10444,"text":"Tailored job title"}],"image":null},{"id":5702,"title":"Recruiter red flags","text":null,"icon":"flag","bullets":[{"id":10445,"text":"Resume credibility"},{"id":10446,"text":"Interview risk signals"},{"id":10447,"text":"Peer benchmarking"},{"id":10448,"text":"LinkedIn profile match"}],"image":null},{"id":5703,"title":"Bias \u0026 discrimination","text":null,"icon":"user-settings","bullets":[{"id":10449,"text":"Age and date bias"},{"id":10450,"text":"Employment gaps"}],"image":null},{"id":5704,"title":"Seniority \u0026 impact","text":null,"icon":"crown","bullets":[{"id":10451,"text":"Career progression"},{"id":10452,"text":"Skills evidence"},{"id":10453,"text":"Leadership signals"}],"image":null}],"__component":"sections.cards"},{"id":2748,"title":"Get an ATS understanding check","text":"\u003cp\u003ePart of the resume checker score we assign is based on the parsability rate of your resume. We’ve reverse-engineered the most popular applicant tracking systems currently used, such as BambooHR, Greenhouse, Lever, SAP SuccessFactors and Workday, and we look for signs of ATS compatibility.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor each resume uploaded, we look for skills and keywords connected to the job and industry you’re applying for, readable contact information, date format, links, file type, and length. Then, we’ll give you suggestions on how to improve your resume.\u003c/p\u003e","mediaPosition":"left","theme":"page-alt","illustration":"resume-parsing","mediaFrame":"none","stickyMedia":false,"titleLevel":"h2","textAfter":null,"titleTag":"h3","pointTag":null,"layout":"checker-row","mediaAlt":null,"bullets":[],"media":null,"button":null,"widget":null,"points":[],"__component":"sections.left-right"},{"id":2749,"title":"Tailor your resume to a job description","text":"\u003cp\u003ePaste the job you’re applying for and our checker will give you job-specific resume tailoring suggestions. It will identify exactly which skills and keywords you already have or are missing from your resume.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdditionally, it will generate an application-ready tailored subtitle and suggest action verbs for your bullet points to be more effective.\u003c/p\u003e","mediaPosition":"right","theme":"page-alt","illustration":"none","mediaFrame":"glow","stickyMedia":false,"titleLevel":"h2","textAfter":null,"titleTag":"h3","pointTag":null,"layout":"checker-row","mediaAlt":null,"bullets":[],"media":{"id":1460,"documentId":"m3zwv1tkbaeq8ugs3vhe7d05","name":"checker-tailoring.mp4","alternativeText":null,"caption":null,"focalPoint":null,"width":null,"height":null,"formats":null,"hash":"checker_tailoring_4c48d62a7b","ext":".mp4","mime":"video/mp4","size":2899.96,"url":"https://cdn.enhancv.com/checker_tailoring_4c48d62a7b.mp4","previewUrl":null,"provider":"strapi-provider-upload-aws-s3-advanced","provider_metadata":null,"folderPath":"/","createdAt":"2026-10-09T11:53:52.022Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-09T11:53:52.022Z","publishedAt":"2026-10-09T11:53:52.022Z","locale":null},"button":null,"widget":null,"points":[],"__component":"sections.left-right"},{"id":2750,"title":"Pass the hiring manager check","text":"\u003cp\u003eATS is just the first step of the recruitment process. Your resume will be judged by a HR manager next and they look for an entirely different set of things. Our checker will analyze your resume for any red flags, such as ambiguity, unintentional age bias, interview risks, leadership signals, skills evidence, and role experience relevance.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThen it will provide actionable tips against criteria that recruiters care about, such as impact, credibility, and quality of your writing.\u003c/p\u003e","mediaPosition":"left","theme":"page-alt","illustration":"none","mediaFrame":"glow","stickyMedia":false,"titleLevel":"h2","textAfter":null,"titleTag":"h3","pointTag":null,"layout":"checker-row","mediaAlt":null,"bullets":[],"